# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/sw/ca-gregorian.json.
# days.format.wide; the abbreviated forms are the same strings.
# The Juma- series counts from Jumamosi (Saturday), so the numeral inside a
# name is two short of the Monday-first index this file is numbered by.
# Jumamosi is juma + mosi (one): Saturday opens the cycle.
jumamosi
